  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "An iron crown eagle’s stomach injury is filled with star path dao marks that make it bleed continuously and prevent the body from healing naturally. Desolate beast injuries leave lingering dao marks that resist self-healing and hinder healing Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        717
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_healing_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Seven Star Child’s fingertip starlight pierces Shi Lei’s chest, countless star path dao marks remain at the wound near his heart, so blood flows without pause until Shi Lei’s own healing Immortal Gu treats him. Ordinary mortal Gu and mortal healing killer moves cannot help.",
      "chapters": [
        726
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wound-near-the-heart",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_seven_star_child",
        "char_shi_lei",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Form land spirit introduces rank six Immortal Gu Star Mark, which can temporarily add six hundred star path dao marks onto its master’s body. Fang Yuan notes that six hundred marks would mean a sixty percent power increase for matching methods, but they are star path marks and he is not a star path Gu Immortal. Activating Star Mark still covers his body in a temporary layer of star path dao marks and lets him disguise as a star path Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        852
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "temporary-marks-as-disguise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Production of star path mortal Gu in arrow bamboo forest and star fragment grass fields depends on star path dao marks. Star Form blessed land focuses on star path and holds more of those marks than the early sovereign immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1066
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-path-resources",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside a star cloud storm, fragments are everywhere and an uncountable number of star path dao marks disrupt the information path communication method between Wei Ling Yang and Bi Chen Tian.",
      "chapters": [
        1245
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "signal-disrupting-site",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_ling_yang",
        "char_bi_chen_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Although a star sea snail is dead, its shell still retains a vast number of star path dao marks. Combat Beast King uses those marks with a transformation path method that relies on dao marks and does not require a living target, merging with the corpse into a star armored giant.",
      "chapters": [
        1689
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "powering-a-corpse-transformation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_combat_beast_king"
      ]
    }
